    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ce6af35b2bcf40328a2c12273890cea8",
      "statement": "The Docker-gate skip logic in pytest_collection_modifyitems, due to Python operator precedence, skips any tests/integration/ file whose filename doesn't contain 'test_telemetry' when Docker is unavailable, exempting only files with 'test_telemetry' in the name and individual tests marked no_docker.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://tests/conftest.py#L75-L91",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8f709a684a9b82aaf3a28eb5b1531ac4d47400a19d6e9e71167f226576752d34:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6960fc9a1d8c48e2a48433bfc6fc8097",
      "statement": "docker-compose.test.yml starts only the ice and otel-collector services, with no Postgres or Redis container, so is_docker_available() will report Docker unavailable in the CI integration-tests job regardless of whether the collector is reachable.",
